Subject: [PATCH] W1-02 Vec3: stage churn benchmark

Stage 2 of W1-02 (Vec3). Compiles chained immutable add/scale against
accumulate-into-caller-mutable form; migration target is NMS Vec3 hot
arithmetic (movement, line-of-sight, explosion falloff).
